arbeitnow:staff-manufacturing-product-en:
&lt;p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-start="135" data-end="148"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="150" data-end="240"&gt;Shape how Graphcore products move from hardware design into reliable volume manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="242" data-end="471"&gt;As Staff Manufacturing Product Engineer, you will support NPI development and volume production across complex hardware products. You will connect design, test, quality and supply chain decisions with real manufacturing outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="473" data-end="671"&gt;Your work will help ensure products are manufacturable, resilient and ready for supplier capability. You will provide DfM feedback that improves PCB and system design before issues reach production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="673" data-end="878"&gt;You will work closely with contract manufacturers, especially during NPI and early volume manufacture. You will drive yield improvement, analyse production data and resolve L6 and L10 manufacturing issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="880" data-end="1082"&gt;This role suits someone who enjoys practical engineering ownership across design and production. You will travel to Taiwan and work close to suppliers shaping next generation manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1084" data-end="1104"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1106" data-end="1291"&gt;You will join the Manufacturing and Technology Process team within Operations. The team works across Bristol, Cambridge and Taiwan, close to foundry, package assembly and PCBA partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1293" data-end="1472"&gt;Work happens through clear ownership, supplier engagement and fast feedback into design teams. You will speak up early when manufacturability, yield or capability needs attention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1474" data-end="1667"&gt;The team values evidence, responsibility and strong cross-regional relationships. Decisions are made through engineering judgement, data and direct accountability for manufacturing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1669" data-end="1691"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we're looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1693" data-end="2226"&gt;· Strong fault diagnosis, problem solving and failure analysis skills, including ICT to SMT debug&lt;br&gt;· Thorough understanding of PCB assembly processes and lean manufacturing methodologies&lt;br&gt;· Working knowledge of L10 mechanical design and system build, ideally for HPC products&lt;br&gt;· Ability to connect silicon, package and PCB interactions into clear DfM feedback&lt;br&gt;· Experience using continuous improvement methods, including SPC and DOE&lt;br&gt;· Strong interpersonal skills for supplier-facing, cross-functional and cross-regional engineering work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2228" data-end="2476"&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. If you meet most of our essential criteria, we encourage you to submit an application and showcase how your background makes you a strong candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2478" data-end="2486"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2488" data-end="3276"&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3278" data-end="3640"&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3642" data-end="3653"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3655" data-end="3811"&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3813" data-end="3839"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3841" data-end="4120"&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4122" data-end="4404"&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4406" data-end="4728"&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4730" data-end="4892" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;If you want to turn hardware design into stronger manufacturing performance, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to help shape how Graphcore products are built.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

